Package: OnukpaTay
Title: OnukpaTay - Professional Quantity Surveyor Assistant
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sedem", "Onukpa-Tay", email = "onukpatay@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R Shiny application supporting GhIS / RICS quantity surveying
    practice. Modules cover Bill of Quantities (BOQ) preparation, Interim
    Payment Certificates (IPC), monthly Valuations & Variations, Contract
    Claims (EOT, loss & expense), and Budgeting / Cost Planning. Standards
    supported: RICS NRM1/NRM2/NRM3, SMM7, JCT and FIDIC contract conventions,
    with Ghana-specific (GhIS) defaults including GHS currency.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
